{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长为周围友军持续提供治疗与增益的辅助，并可随战斗推进而不断成长。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","又有谁需要提提神了？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Who else needs a little pick-me-up?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","药劲上来了，价格也得提一提！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The medicine's more potent, so the price needs to match."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","哎哟，快、快多撒点儿香料！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ah! Quick! More herbs!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","水……兑得太多了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Should've... used... some of the real stuff."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","就说了，我们不卖假货！！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Just saying, we don't sell ripoffs."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","香料和药水准备好了吗？客人上门了！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","呜呜，没事吧？小心点！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","你看看，不對勁，沒有，沒有，小心點，別送蟹了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","薰香强壮身心，藥水保之百病。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","诶哟，这东西一定很值钱吧！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","拿到就算赚到。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","荒土药师"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","狡兔三窟，制药和逃命都要顺手才行。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","冬裘新庆"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","生活再不易，也要给孩子们装点些节日氛围不是？"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这味道，够劲！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","再兑点儿水进去……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","套餐有优惠没有？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有人要御寒药剂吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节特别折扣！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这灯笼真吉利啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","特制烟花降价啦！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","阿熏给自己定下规矩，不骗生活比自己更辛苦的人。但很少遇到。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","阿熏喜欢给蒙蒙讲故事。蒙蒙以为都是假的，其实却不然。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会把最好的食物留给蒙蒙。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿熏骗人熟练，道歉更熟练，完成下跪这一动作仅需一秒。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","其实也有人看他带着孩子可怜，请阿熏帮忙，但阿熏稳定不下来。这样的生活已成习惯。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会喝酒，但遇到蒙蒙后戒了。影响不好，也没闲钱。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","蒙蒙知道阿熏和自己没有血缘关系。但它知道谁对自己最好。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","如果有开张的日子，阿熏会给蒙蒙一笔零花钱，这些钱都被蒙蒙存起来。数目可观。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","阿熏会用树叶吹乐曲。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿熏最喜欢躺在地上晒太阳，肚子暖暖的。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","谁说不存在所谓的畅销药剂？很多人根本就不识货。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","累了？尝尝这个？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411160.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这味道，够劲！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415074.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","套餐有优惠没有？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415075.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn